{"id":"n16201-1-10","stage":3,"title":"간격 · 间隔","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16201-1-10-1","ko":"우리 그냥 계단으로 걸어서 올라가자.","zh":"我们还是步行上楼梯吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样。","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"계단으로","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계단으로","audio":"/audio/f2997ad0da3f6e9d73b9.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어서","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어서","audio":"/audio/ccc311521d028aa1de80.mp3"}},{"text":"올라가자.","meaning":"上，上去","explanation":"올라가다：上，上去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라가자","audio":"/audio/fa4f96f1cdb0f05220f5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"cbd5d64a59da9222","term":"계단","zh":"阶梯，楼梯","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3","entryId":"23937","definition":"为了上下走动而按顺序把小台阶倾斜连接起来的设施。","pronunciation":["계단","게단"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，上去","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"从下向上，从低处前往高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3f4392641dd80b52d71.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16201-1-10-2","ko":"이 건물은 층 사이의 간격이 넓어서 계단으로 올라가긴 힘들어.","zh":"这栋楼的楼层间距很大，走楼梯上去挺费力的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"건물은","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건물은","audio":"/audio/579a3be81f22a6599d91.mp3"}},{"text":"층","meaning":"层","explanation":"층：层。","readings":[{"term":"층","audio":"/audio/5987e716eafb9e902330.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20264","senseId":"2","lemma":"층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"층","audio":"/audio/5987e716eafb9e902330.mp3"}},{"text":"사이의","meaning":"间，之间，间距","explanation":"사이：间，之间，间距；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이의","audio":"/audio/e55cd4d5a53087a920e2.mp3"}},{"text":"간격이","meaning":"间隔","explanation":"간격：间隔；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"간격","audio":"/audio/c5aa95186fcb7251128c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16201","senseId":"1","lemma":"간격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간격이","audio":"/audio/83651f6fcebecfc3ae31.mp3"}},{"text":"넓어서","meaning":"宽敞，宽阔，宽广","explanation":"넓다：宽敞，宽阔，宽广；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넓다","audio":"/audio/a1c6fc943afd6c1195c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64511","senseId":"1","lemma":"넓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넓어서","audio":"/audio/f70aff965fea7000b2fe.mp3"}},{"text":"계단으로","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계단으로","audio":"/audio/f2997ad0da3f6e9d73b9.mp3"}},{"text":"올라가긴","meaning":"上，上去","explanation":"올라가다：上，上去；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라가긴","audio":"/audio/5cdb74bae809833e8481.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들어.","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들어","audio":"/audio/42a96966a9378057f47c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/au